 fit=dict(starter="Bear markets early in life can be gifts; you buy more for less.", mom="Keep your family's near-term money out of stocks.", rebuilder="A steady plan protects you from fear-based decisions.", ent="Prepare your business and household for slower seasons.", exec="Do not let a strong bull market tempt you into too much company stock.", late="Keep steadier money in place as retirement nears.", retiree="Hold several years of withdrawals outside stocks so you never sell low.", legacy="Teach your family that markets have seasons."),
